@startuml
title LockStatus / LockStage / Provider Status Relation
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Public LockResult" as public {
  class LockStatus {
    ACQUIRED
    SUCCESS
    NOT_ACQUIRED
    EXECUTION_FAILED
    LOCK_LOST
    FENCING_REJECTED
    RELEASE_FAILED
    PROVIDER_ERROR
    INVALID_OPTIONS
  }
  class LockStage {
    VALIDATE
    ACQUIRE
    WAIT
    EXECUTE
    FENCING
    RENEW
    RELEASE
    CHECK
  }
}

rectangle "Provider Protocol" as provider {
  class LockAcquireStatus {
    ACQUIRED
    NOT_ACQUIRED
    PROVIDER_ERROR
  }
  class LockRenewStatus {
    RENEWED
    NOT_FOUND
    NOT_OWNER
    PROVIDER_ERROR
  }
  class LockReleaseStatus {
    RELEASED
    NOT_FOUND
    NOT_OWNER
    PROVIDER_ERROR
  }
  class LockCheckStatus {
    HELD
    NOT_FOUND
    NOT_OWNER
    PROVIDER_ERROR
  }
}

LockAcquireStatus --> LockStatus : outcome handlers map to public result
LockRenewStatus --> LockStatus : DefaultLockHandle / watchdog maps lost or provider error
LockReleaseStatus --> LockStatus : LockReleaseOutcome + resolver
LockCheckStatus --> LockStatus : checkHeld / external fencing verification
LockStage --> LockStatus : stage explains where status happened
@enduml
